# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .dockerignore - files never sent to `docker build`.
# The images only need pyproject.toml and src/. Everything else is excluded so
# builds are fast and nothing local (datasets, models, credentials, the venv)
# can end up inside an image by accident.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*
!pyproject.toml
!src/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
